    {
        "content": "<p>Hi all,</p>\n<p>This is the KConfig file being used on our GFXBench benchmarks, in case anybody attempts to replicate them. Thanks to <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"532207\">@Sami Tolvanen</span> for this.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/user_uploads/35136/LLOOvrl9EDTAxCF_tcPXl7Xf/config.tyr.performance\">config.tyr.performance</a></p>",
        "id": 623161183,
        "sender_full_name": "Daniel Almeida",
        "timestamp": 1789049036
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I get this reproduced with gl_5_normal test.<br>\nIt is not the kernel driver issue but the userspace one.<br>\n<code>261.803599] tyr: tyr fault_debug: pt_update exec map va=0x7ffeffe00000..0x7fff09600000 bo_offset=0x0 flags=0x2 prot=0xf</code><br>\n The fault address is:</p>\n<p>0x7ffeffffe400</p>\n<p>That is inside the mapped range:</p>\n<p>0x7ffeffe00000..0x7fff09600000</p>\n<p>The first fault is not a missing mapping. It is an execute permission fault while the software page table still says the page is present</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">18</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">262.817963</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Unhandled</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Page</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AS2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">VA</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x00007FFEFFFFE400</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">19</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">262.817963</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">raw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x40001CA</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">262.817963</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decoded</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">SLAVE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FAULT</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">21</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">262.817963</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0xCA</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">PERM_FAULT_2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">22</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">262.817963</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">access</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">EXECUTE</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">23</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">262.817963</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">source</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x400</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>GPU instruction fetch from a VA that is mapped as NOEXEC</p>\n<p>The later TRANSLATION_FAULT_2 entries are secondary. The same range is unmapped first</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"mi\">218</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.021044</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">tyr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault_debug</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">vm_bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unmap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">va</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7ffeffe00000</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7fff09600000</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x9800000</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">219</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.021936</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">tyr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault_debug</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">vm_bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unmap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">va</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7ffeffe00000</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7fff09600000</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x9800000</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">220</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.022758</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">tyr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault_debug</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">pt_update</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unmap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">va</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7ffeffe00000</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7fff09600000</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">221</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.023481</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">tyr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault_debug</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">mmu</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">start_vm_update</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">range</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7ffeffe00000</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7fff09600000</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">222</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.024264</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">tyr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault_debug</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">pt_update</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">begin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unmap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">range</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7ffeffe00000</span><s