">265.196012</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">access</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">EXECUTE</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">230</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.196012</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">source</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x2410</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I won't probably have the cycles to track what's happening on the userspace front. At least not this week.</p>",
